@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Natural Language and UML Round Trip
rectangle "Natural Language" as NL
rectangle "Requirement IR" as IR
rectangle "Feature Intent" as FI
rectangle "Solver Validated Configuration" as VC
rectangle "Architecture Graph" as AG
rectangle "UML Projection" as UML
rectangle "Change Proposal" as CP
rectangle "Natural Language Explanation" as EX

NL --> IR : compile with source quotes
IR --> FI : map candidates and confidence
FI --> VC : solve hard constraints
VC --> AG : synthesize components and interfaces
AG --> UML : deterministic projection
UML --> CP : reviewed edit delta
CP --> EX : explain affected features and requirements
EX --> IR : approved new version
CP --> VC : mandatory revalidation

note bottom of UML
UML is not the variability source of truth.
Every element carries Requirement, Feature,
Component and Interface identifiers.
end note
@enduml
